{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o065a","title":"李胜诣司马懿司马懿佯病李胜信之","accounts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o065a-account","label":"《诸夏侯曹传第九》正文","text":"李胜诣司马懿司马懿佯病李胜信之","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o065a-q"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p030a-account","label":"《魏末传》","text":"李胜奉曹爽意察病司马懿佯疾错称并州","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p030a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0029","role":"察病","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o065a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0364","role":"佯疾","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o065a-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0056","role":"令察","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p030a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":248,"label":"正始九年冬","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xiahoucao-y248","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xiahoucao-q-o065","basis":"正始九年冬"},"evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o065a-q","xiahoucao-q-o065","xiahoucao-q-b-689bb125a4b85ddbcec4"]},"ordering_evidence":"xiahoucao-e-o065a-q","source_order":[9,283,"O065a"],"order":2267}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0056","name":"曹爽","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0029","name":"李胜","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0364","name":"司马懿","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o065a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-3bc419f393ba695bc235","layer":"original","quote":"宣王密为之备。九年冬〖22〗，李胜出为荆州刺史，往诣宣王。宣王称疾，困笃〖23〗，示以羸形〖24〗；胜不能觉，谓之信然〖25〗。﹝二﹞","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":282,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":67,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p030a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-5f75a871b7462d4ccaa5","layer":"pei","quote":"爽等令胜辞宣王，并伺察焉。宣王见胜，胜自陈：‘无他功劳，横蒙特恩，当为本州；诣<拜辞，不悟加恩，得蒙引见。’宣王令两婢侍边，持衣，衣落；复上指口，言渴求饮；婢进粥，宣王持杯饮粥，粥皆流出沾胸。胜愍然，为之涕泣，谓宣王曰：‘今主上尚幼，天下恃赖明公。然众情谓明公方旧风疾发；何意尊体乃尔！’宣王徐更宽言，才令气息相属，说：‘年老沉疾，死在旦夕。君当屈并州，并州近胡，好善为之；恐不复相见，如何！’胜曰：‘当还忝本州，非并州也！’宣王乃复佯为昏谬，曰：‘君方到并州，努力自爱！’错乱其辞，状如荒语。胜复曰：‘当忝荆州，非并州也！’宣王乃若微悟者，谓胜曰：‘懿年老，意荒忽，不解君言。今还为本州刺史，盛德壮烈，好建功勋。今当与君别，自顾气力转微，后必不更会；因欲自力，设薄主人；生死共别，令师、昭兄弟，结君为友；不可相舍去，副懿区区之心。’因流涕哽咽。胜亦长叹，答曰：‘辄当承教，须待敕命！","attribution":"《魏末传》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":311,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6cbbee0b38b546906385","start":11,"end":403,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-b-689bb125a4b85ddbcec4","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-689bb125a4b85ddbcec4","layer":"modern","quote":"〖22〗九年：正始九年（公元 248）。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":305,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e0757d03d6de78145e0e","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o065","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-3bc419f393ba695bc235","layer":"original","quote":"宣王密为之备。九年冬〖22〗，李胜出为荆州刺史，往诣宣王。宣王称疾，困笃〖23〗，示以羸形〖24〗；胜不能觉，谓之信然〖25〗。﹝二﹞","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":282,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":67,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
